# Bank statement formats

Statement import accepts **CSV, XLSX, XLS, OFX, and QIF**, all parsed into the same bank-line rows (`date`, `amount`, `description`). Feeds are HTTPS file URLs of those formats.

Do **not** add Plaid, TrueLayer, Yodlee, or other live open-banking clients until a named provider is chosen. A file URL is not a card-network feed.

When adding a format: parse into the same bank-line rows; do not invent a second matching engine.
